  "historicalNotes": [
    "The Vedic lists do not all begin with Ashwini; several early lists begin with Krittika.",
    "Names and presiding deities can differ across textual recensions and historical periods.",
    "Some sources include Abhijit as a 28th asterism; this project keeps the computational set at 27 and records Abhijit only as historical context.",
    "The deity field is not interchangeable with the Vimshottari nakshatra ruler, the zodiac sign lord, or HORA's nine-fold nakshatra type.",
    "For Mūla, the later 27-equal-division list in the Pustakalaya reference gives Nirṛti, while the Bṛhat Saṃhitā chapter 98 list gives Prajāpati. Preserve both as source-specific variants."
  ],
  "prohibitedInferences": [
